{{Top}}
A '''reputation merit''' was a digital point system which indicated that a [[bounty hunter]] has successfully accomplished a mission.<ref name="Mandalorian1">{{TheMandalorian|Chapter 1: The Mandalorian}}</ref> In [[9 ABY]],<ref name="Mandalorian date">{{MandoDate|1}}</ref> the [[IG-series]] [[droid]] [[bounty]] hunter [[IG-11]] insisted that he must receive reputation merits from the [[Bounty Hunters' Guild]] before agreeing to join forces with the bounty hunter known as [[Din Djarin|the Mandalorian]] on a [[Mission to Arvala-7|mission]] on [[Arvala-7]] to recover "[[Din Grogu|the asset]]."<ref name="Mandalorian1" />

